00274: {"assertion_index":272,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L068","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":68,"full_assertion":"目标计算：ASSAULTVEST 特殊 D ×1.5；DEEPSEASCALE 原 CLAMPERL 特殊 D ×2；EVIOLITE 持久个体当前形态物种记录有至少一条有效后续进化（排前进化和方法 None）则 D ×1.5，不先检查当下能否满足进化条件；METALPOWDER 原 DITTO 且未变身 D ×1.5，两类别都可；SOULDEW 在上述设置假、原双水都、特殊且无条款时 D ×1.5。"}
00275: {"assertion_index":273,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L161","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":161,"full_assertion":"| ASSAULTVEST／三讲究物 | 命令规格选择/执行门，背心只命令阶段限制变化（抢先使用例外），讲究锁在结束行动记录；本文件数值槽不能替代动作门 |"}
