00279: {"assertion_index":277,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L104","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":104,"full_assertion":"| ABSORBBULB／LUMINOUSMOSS／CELLBATTERY／SNOWBALL | 分别水→特攻 1/水→特防 1/电→攻 1/冰→攻 1；可升才提交并通用已触发消费 |"}
00280: {"assertion_index":278,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L024","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":24,"full_assertion":"| OnBeingHit（13） | ABSORBBULB、AIRBALLOON、CELLBATTERY、ENIGMABERRY、JABOCABERRY、KEEBERRY、LUMINOUSMOSS、MARANGABERRY、ROCKYHELMET、ROWAPBERRY、SNOWBALL、STICKYBARB、WEAKNESSPOLICY | WP50 §5.1；JABO→U恢复物品→下一击的提交边界见 §5.1.1 |"}
00281: {"assertion_index":279,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L031","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":31,"full_assertion":"普通消费先 R=C、P=C 及递增序号（可回收开），允许的树果设 Belch；再清 C、若 C=I 清 I、无 GORILLATACTICS 清讲究锁、UNBURDEN 有效置轻装，最后可共生。AIRBALLOON 的不可回收消费不新写 R/P，不等于清空先前 R/P。退出包/按钮关闭消费时共生，红牌普通消费可先共生再检查是否拖出。C 改变后后续 helper 读取当前物品，可能递归触发；没有通用一轮一次或事务回滚。正常终局读 I 还原的范围/显式中止不还原的风险沿战斗结果规格。"}
00282: {"assertion_index":280,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L105","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":105,"full_assertion":"| AIRBALLOON | 提示破裂，消费不可回收、允许共生，再显式共生检查一次；不要求本击实际 hpLost>0，中央外层 calcDamage 门足够；浮空消失可影响后续击 |"}
00283: {"assertion_index":281,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L038","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":38,"full_assertion":"| OnSwitchIn（2） | AIRBALLOON、ROOMSERVICE | WP50 §6 |"}
00284: {"assertion_index":282,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L106","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":106,"full_assertion":"| ENIGMABERRY | 非替身/非画皮/非冰脸且克制才转正向受击果 helper；helper 需 canHeal，非 forced 须可食果，请求 H 整除 4，RIPEN ×2；真才通用消费 |"}
00285: {"assertion_index":283,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L025","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":25,"full_assertion":"| OnBeingHitPositiveBerry（3） | ENIGMABERRY、KEEBERRY、MARANGABERRY | WP50 §5.1 |"}
00286: {"assertion_index":284,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L108","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":108,"full_assertion":"| JABOCABERRY／ROWAPBERRY | 可食果，物理/特殊招，U 可间伤才损 U 总 HP 整除 8，T 有效 RIPEN 将已整除量 ×2，通用消费；不要求接触。T 已倒下时它的 RIPEN 常规查询未必活跃，不能沿外层允许倒下扩大能力门 |"}
00287: {"assertion_index":285,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L107","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":107,"full_assertion":"| KEEBERRY／MARANGABERRY | 物理/特殊命中分别转正向受击果 helper，非 forced 食果门、中央可升防/特防，＋1 或 RIPEN＋2；真才消费。不被此层 SHEERFORCE 统一禁止，完整后段抑制是另一处 |"}
00288: {"assertion_index":286,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L109","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":109,"full_assertion":"| ROCKYHELMET | 实际接触且 U 接触许可、可间伤，U 损 H 整除 6，不消费 |"}
00289: {"assertion_index":287,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L110","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":110,"full_assertion":"| STICKYBARB | 实际接触且 U 接触许可、存活且无物：直接 T.C→U.C、T.C 清，T 轻装有效置标记；野生战、U 为玩家侧且 U.I 空、转物=T.I 时转 I 并清 T.I。不走消费、不写 R/P，不统一立即触发新持物 |"}
00290: {"assertion_index":288,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L036","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":36,"full_assertion":"| EndOfRoundEffect（3） | FLAMEORB、STICKYBARB、TOXICORB | WP50 §6 |"}
00291: {"assertion_index":289,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L111","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":111,"full_assertion":"| WEAKNESSPOLICY | 排画皮/冰脸，要求克制且攻/特攻至少可升一项；依攻＋2 → 特攻＋2 各自资格、部分成功，之后通用消费；不因升一项而额外升另一封顶项 |"}
00292: {"assertion_index":290,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L128","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":128,"full_assertion":"- EJECTBUTTON：后段目标物入口，尚无已换席、对侧未全灭、有后备才消费（禁共生）→ 选替补。**不检查普通换出拘束门**；负选择不回滚消费；成功替换/清选择/记已换/按 U 身份清模式破坏/入场。"}
00293: {"assertion_index":291,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L026","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":26,"full_assertion":"| AfterMoveUseFromTarget（2） | EJECTBUTTON、REDCARD | WP50 §5.2 |"}
00294: {"assertion_index":292,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L129","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":129,"full_assertion":"- REDCARD：同入口，尚无已换且 U 活；先随机选 U 合格后备，无候选不消耗；再普通消费红牌（可共生），**随后**有效 SUCTIONCUPS 且非模式破坏或扎根可挡实际拖出。已耗不退；成功拖出 U、清选择、记已换、模式破坏假、入场。不是野生终局逃跑处理器。"}
00295: {"assertion_index":293,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L130","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":130,"full_assertion":"- LIFEORB 后段 U 物：U 可间伤、实际伤害招、击数 >0 且至少一个原目标非 unaffected/非替身，损 U 总 HP 整除 10 → 恢复物品 → 濒死；不消费。所有击最终替身标志/后段 SHEERFORCE 门可使有增伤却无此扣 HP。"}
00296: {"assertion_index":294,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L131","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":131,"full_assertion":"- SHELLBELL：U 可恢复，累加每目标 totalHPLost（含替身跨击量），正值则请求总和整除 8。恢复达半可清跨半事件，随后危急回避可能不再触发；本快照未保留官方例外。不消费，不用总 calcDamage。"}
00297: {"assertion_index":295,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L132","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":132,"full_assertion":"- THROATSPRAY：双方参与队伍未全灭，声音招、实计击数 >0 且 U 可升特攻，＋1 后直接消费；不是必须伤害类，局部无「伤害>0」门。"}
00298: {"assertion_index":296,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L092","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":92,"full_assertion":"LEPPABERRY 用**持久个体招式列表**收 PP 有损且总 PP>0 的槽，非 forced 仅有空 PP 槽可触发；forced 可在无空槽时选首个部分损 PP 槽。都先空槽的首个，不按最低百分比或随机。非 forced 还查食果。请求 10，RIPEN 20，持久 PP 钳到上限，然后**直接把同下标战斗槽 PP 写成持久新值，不检查身份相同或变身**；与《HP、状态、招式与持物》通常专门同步入口不同，必须单列例外。当前真实招式不同也可能收到数值，不能由通用 PP 归属推断这次不回读；两赋值先后不原子。返回真才通用消费。"}
00299: {"assertion_index":297,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L028","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":28,"full_assertion":"| OnEndOfUsingMove（1） | LEPPABERRY | WP50 §4 |"}
00300: {"assertion_index":298,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-effect-coverage-L029","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-effect-coverage.md","line":29,"full_assertion":"| OnEndOfUsingMoveStatRestore（1） | WHITEHERB | WP50 §4 |"}
00301: {"assertion_index":299,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption-L150","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp50-held-item-triggers-and-consumption.md","line":150,"full_assertion":"| ExpGainModifier LUCKYEGG | 当前收益 ×3 整除 2；无登记 −1 使消费者回看 I。不是从第一个经验基数重新开公式 |"}
